er b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422471#post1422471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, do they add pumpkin spice to the blood outside the body, or do they make their victims drink the latte?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think part of the issue here is that some people are thinking Wicca and Neo Age baristas and I'm thinking of Macbeth, human sacrifice, Circe, and Morgan Le Fey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-07T12:55:06-08:00","id":1422479,"title":"","content":"I imagine Ipissmus is still Hermetic, or &quot;Wizard Classic&quot; as you put it, but they're experimenting with Punk sorcery and Technomancy in a way that makes some more conservative Tremere a little uncomfortable (perhaps even jealous). Still, Mainline Tremere have their technomagic, they're just not trying to put rituals into code. What Ipissmus is doing will inevitably catch on with the main clan given a decade or so. The Real Divide between HI and HT is who's territory their chantries are in, and perhaps the neonate-ancillae-elder ratios. <br /> <br /> Punk sorcery is fully compatible with the hermetic paradigm, as is Technomancy. Though I don't imagine all hermetics see it that way. <br /> <br /> I reason that being a member of House Tremere can't be so oppressive. And if you're in the House, you probably develop the sense that being left outside on your own is the worse option. The Tremere might demand communal havens of most members, but it's a really nice place, with plenty of room, excellent security, an easy blood supply and no doubt an excellent hunting ground thanks to the Tremere's ability to rake in the boons. You have funds. Everyone other vampire in your chantry may be potentially a rival, but most of them are likeminded, and they're unlikely to want or be able to kill you. Also, your boss ain't going to overwork you; what did Strauss say? &quot;True wealth lies in the things it affords you&quot; Yeah they're sure to have leisure time. Even if your boss does want to overwork you, can vampires physically feel fatigue from overwork? And if you're out and about and trouble comes your way, the Brand of Tremere serves to stave off many dangers. Outside? That's dog eat dog; everyone's fighting over domain and territory and resources and politics and... You probably couldn't get any work done. All that fighting? Just imagine how hard it would be to secure and replicate a domain equal to what a chantry provides. Imagine how many people would covet your thaumaturgy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-07T12:57:09-08:00","id":1422480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422472#post1422472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think part of the issue here is that some people are thinking Wicca and Neo Age baristas and I'm thinking of Macbeth, human sacrifice, Circe, and Morgan Le Fey.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Tremere do not use wands. Robes are however worn within the chantry. <br /> <br /> But... yeah, nah, where are you going to find your latter group in the modern era? Prison?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-07T16:55:10-08:00","id":1422514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422472#post1422472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think part of the issue here is that some people are thinking Wicca and Neo Age baristas and I'm thinking of Macbeth, human sacrifice, Circe, and Morgan Le Fey.</div> </div> </div> </div>How hard it runs into baby eating witches will depend on the group. That said I can see a lot of drama in a story where some neonates come from the Wicca and Neo Age baristas get roped into a ceremony involving bleeding to death kidnapped children, with the neonates thinking to themselves &quot;What have I gotten myself into?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422467#post1422467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your Tremere don't wear robes during ceremonies?<br /> <br /> Okay.<br /> <br /> 0/10<br /> <br /> Losers.<br /> <br /> I can't even look at your posts anymore, dude. :shudder:</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, fine, I will wear a robe.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://ak1.ostkcdn.com/images/products/is/images/direct/ed77d3edfba4c2ae38e9dfc49ddcfe9fa4b0f6da/Richie-House-Men%27s-Warm-and-Soft-Fleece-Robe-Bathrobe.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1208,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","user":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","date":". 11-07-2020, 08:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T03:06:24-08:00","id":1422576,"title":"","content":"Just so I can make a post here for fun and not out of Rabid rage. I'd like to go through a 'ranking' of different thaumaturgical factions. Trying to be objective as possible; this isn't about my personal opinion of these factions and what I like and dislike, this is a list trying to tier them by how effective they should be. <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">S Tier</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>House Tremere</b><br /> Organization: A<br /> Paradigm: A<br /> <br /> + Magic in the blood.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>House Ippismus</b><br /> Organization: A<br /> Paradigm: A<br /> +Magic in the blood<br /> -Shitty name I can never get right</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">A Tier</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Assamite Sorcerers</b><br /> Organization: B<br /> Paradigm: B<br /> <br /> +Magic in the Blood</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>House Goratrix (V5)</b><br /> Organization: A<br /> Paradigm: A<br /> +Magic in the blood<br /> -In a sect that hates them<br /> -In a sect that might as well be destroyed.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Telyavs</b><br /> Organization: B<br /> Paradigm: <b>A</b><br /> +Magic in the Blood<br /> +God of Bees<br /> -Baltic paganism is pretty dead.<br /> Presence is an expensive choice in all but V5, but it helps reinforce Telyavs as cult leaders.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">B Tier</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Followers of Set</b><br /> Organization: B<br /> Paradigm: B</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Bahari:</b><br /> Organization: Varies. Probably C<br /> Paradigm: Varies<br /> +Weeds out the 'weak'.<br /> +Strong magic focus<br /> -Heretics according to almost everyone</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Baali Hives</b><br /> Organization: A<br /> Paradigm: B<br /> Infernalism is a mixed bag.<br /> +Secrecy AND well organized.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Koldun</b><br /> Organization: C<br /> Paradigm: C, but not really relevant for what they do.<br /> +Stronger at lower levels.<br /> +more unknown to outsiders</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Church of Caine (V5)</b><br /> Organization B<br /> Paradigm B<br /> <br /> As a product of V5, their magic is garbage, but it would be unfair to use that against them in a meta-list with the other editions in mind.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">C<br /> Tier</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Noddists</b><br /> Organization: C<br /> Paradigm: Varies<br /> -Not as focused on magic as their Bahari enemy</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Punk Sorcerers</b><br /> Organization: D<br /> Paradigm: B<br /> +Genius<br /> -Antagonistic</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>New Agers</b><br /> Organization: C<br /> Paradigm: C<br /> -Low path and ritual Variety<br /> +The Rituals they do have are really strong, and the paths they have are great for beginners.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Church of Set (V5)</b><br /> Organization: C<br /> Paradigm: D</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Ministry of Set (V5)</b><br /> Organization: D<br /> Paradigm: C/D<br /> Tempting to put this as D Tier</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>&quot;Old School&quot;</b><br /> Organization: D<br /> Paradigm: B,C or D.<br /> +Everyone who does this is old, or learning from someone old.<br /> -Neo pagans<br /> +Stronger historically and outside europe/NA</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Independent Demonoligists</b><br /> Organization- None.<br /> Paradigm: B+<br /> +secrecy<br /> -Your tutor wants to kill you<br /> +Anyone that can do this is a fucking top-teir maddog<br /> -Few people can actually do this.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Wagna</b><br /> Organization: D<br /> Paradigm C (It's fairly new)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Sadhanna</b><br /> Oranization: C<br /> Paradigm: B<br /> -Seems common enough to be devalued in india.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">D</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Independent infernalists</b><br /> Organization: Vaires<br /> Paradigm:Varies<br /> -Usually have no idea how their own magic works<br /> -Literally eat shit.<br /> +Quick path to power.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Sihr<br /> (Islamic Assamite sorcery)</b><br /> Organization: C<br /> Paradigm: D<br /> +magic in the blood.<br /> -Restrictive<br /> -Contradictory paradigm</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">F</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>House Carna</b><br /> (Taken at face value)<br /> Organization: D<br /> Paradigm: D<br /> +Magic in the blood.<br /> -Put themselves in direct opposition to S-Tier Forces<br /> -In a sect which largely dislikes their ideas and ideals.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> </tr> </table></div> A good organization is a combination of powerful or secretive, and thus fosters a good and secure learning environment free from threats, and has good access to learning resources or tutors.<br /> <br /> A good paradigm is one which is safer, and is diverse enough to include a wider variety of powers, while being strong and coherent enough to increase focus/will and be understood by peers who adhere closely to a paradigm's formulas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 11-09-2020, 03:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T14:27:43-08:00","id":1422663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422472#post1422472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think part of the issue here is that some people are thinking Wicca and Neo Age baristas and I'm thinking of Macbeth, human sacrifice, Circe, and Morgan Le Fey.</div> </div> </div> </div>I Like this. What about House Goratrix?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T14:36:34-08:00","id":1422665,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ve always imagined that House Goratrix looks kinda like it crawled out of a medieval manuscript describing dark magic mixed with the Satanic Panic.<br /> <br /> I mean like, the tremere also kinda look like a Satanic Panicker\u2019s nightmare but still.<br /> <br /> You\u2019ve got all the usual trappings of Thaumaturgical Hermeticism with the added flair of blood sacrifices, wicked invocations, abominations of science and the like. Hermetics have a trend of flirting with infernalists when they harness the power of the diabolical so I imagine the Inquisition was always pretty wary of the Goratrix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T15:06:32-08:00","id":1422670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422663#post1422663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I Like this. What about House Goratrix?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think of them as being full-on Transylvania and Classic Universal Horror. They have weird laboratories with Steampunk motiffs and DIY mad scientist laboratories to make monsters, potions, and so on.<br /> <br /> Doctor Doom, Frankenstein, and 1950s evil.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T00:30:52-08:00","id":1422702,"title":"","content":"Made some updates to my Tier list (because it would be a shame to be <i>wrong) </i><br /> -Telyav paradigm is better (more hermetic) than I recalled. So I put them up (where i was originally going to put them but did not) <br /> -Sihr, or Islamic sorcery, is worse than I recalled. It seems the writers use it as an example of a failed paradigm. <br /> <br /> <br /> Goratrix doing horror stuff: Yes<br /> But also<br /> Don't normal Tremere do that stuff too? <br /> The only difference is Goratrix have more of certain fresh 'materials' due to not even pretending to be humane. <br /> <br /> (also vampires don't seem to make potions. At best, Settites brew... magic Beer. They've got bottles of ingredients everywhere, but vampire potions? No. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T07:05:25-08:00","id":1422736,"title":"","content":"imo, House Carna would fit better in the sabbat,<br /> the book of the grave war is still dumb though and should be retconned","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 11-09-2020, 02:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T07:15:01-08:00","id":1422738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421860-house-carna-discussion-thread-the-good-the-bad-and-the-witchy?p=1422736#post1422736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the book of the grave war is still dumb though and should be retconned</div> </div> </div> </div>It makes for a good McGuffin, to set a plot in motion, to get the PCs to do something that involves House Carna.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T11:36:15-08:00","id":1422789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__l